expression: text
---
Add a profile, or change the server of an existing one. HTTPS only, plain http
only for localhost and 127.0.0.1.

Usage: hn profile add [OPTIONS] --server <URL> <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>  Profile name

Options:
      --server <URL>  Server URL
  -h, --help          Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn profile add work --server https://hydronode.tech
  hn profile add local --server http://localhost:8080
